Bind Npc 26052 Zone 1

On greeting
    If quest 220 is started and player has 910051000
        Say "I'm the Watcher of Keys, the guardian of the second key!  You are qualified to answer the question since you possess the [First Key]. Do you want to hear it?"
        Topic "Accepted" do
            Say "What did the god Pathos originally govern?"
            Topic "The God of Change" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910051000
                    Give 1 of 910052000
            Topic "The God of Creation" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910051000
                    Say "Your answer is incorrect. Pathos is the god of change and confusion. Your [First Key] has been consumed as penalty. I will leave now in search of the secret of the keys."
        Topic "Rejected" goto close
    Else if quest 220 is started
        Say "I'm the Watcher of Keys, the guardian of the second key! I only pose the question to those who bring the [First Key]."
    Else
        Say ""
